   "text": "\\[\\begin{aligned}&102^{50}=(100+2)^{50}\\\\[5pt]&98^{50}=(100-2)^{50}\\\\[5pt]&\\text{The two expansions differ only in the}\\\\[5pt]&\\text{signs of the odd$-$power terms.}\\end{aligned}\\]",
