   "title": "Subtract",
   "text": "\\[\\begin{aligned}&102^{50}-98^{50}=2\\left[C(50,1)100^{49}(2)+C(50,3)100^{47}(2)^3+\\dots\\right]\\\\[5pt]&\\text{Even$-$power terms cancel; all the rest}\\\\[5pt]&\\text{are positive.}\\end{aligned}\\]",
